# E01 Reactive in a sequential, fixed order, 100 turns (the example never stops): a variant of the oracles, the original sources but its line (tests/tools/csharp-ref/ref/Oracles/ReactiveSeq/).
# Sequential, so the C# fixes every line: the whole trace in order, the senders of the messages included.
ignore ^$
cover all
fact trace ^(.+)$
same trace seq
